# From "Nonphysical Friends" (Wave VI - Odyssey, CD2-4): an invocation
# similar in spirit to the Affirmation and channel-restriction.gws, followed
# by asking four known, trusted guides to flank and lift you, in two stages.

@segment   nonphysical-friends
@title     Nonphysical Friends
@levels    F12
@duration  ~5m

say Feel the energy moving through every cell of your physical body.
pause 6
say Say in your mind. I deeply desire the help and cooperation, the assistance, the understanding of those individuals whose wisdom, development, and experience are equal to or greater than my own.
pause 8
say I ask their guidance and protection. I ask that the light of their being, the light of their source, surround me and assist me in this exercise.
pause 8
say Now in Focus 12, ask for the assistance of four guides — guides you know and trust. Ask for their help with what you desire.
pause 8
say Feel them approaching. Two moving to one side of you, two to the other. Feel their presence, right there beside you.
pause 8
say Ask them to assist you. Feel the light of their being merge with yours — their support lifting you, further from your physical body.
pause 10
say Feel yourself moving upward, calmly, guided. Your energy body rising, more and more.
pause 8
say You're above your physical body now. Calm and secure, a guide on either side.
pause 8
say Now, gently, let them bring you back — back to Focus 12, back to the familiar.
pause 8
say Relax here, your guides still beside you.
pause 6
say Ask them again to help you move upward. Feel them lift you — higher this time. Confidently, you move with them, further from the physical.
pause 10
say You're free now. Explore. Simply be open to what's here.
hold 90
say Let your guides bring you gently back to Focus 12.
pause 6
say Relax, in the familiar state.
pause 5
say Express gratitude for all you've experienced. Let it radiate through you.
pause 6
